# @name createWeek2Assignment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/{{assignmentCourseId}}/modules/{{assignmentModuleId}}/contents/assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Spring Boot and JPA Assignment",
  "position": 1,
  "instructions": "Implement JPA entities and repositories. Submit a short report.",
  "deadline": "2026-11-20T23:00:00Z",
  "allowLateSubmission": false
}

### 20. Get Assignment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/18
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 21. Get Week 2 Contents
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/{{assignmentCourseId}}/modules/{{assignmentModuleId}}/contents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 22. Nonexistent Assignment - expect 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/999999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

