@codingCourseId = 1
@codingModuleId = 2

### Create Coding Exercise
# @name createCodingExercise
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses/{{codingCourseId}}/modules/{{codingModuleId}}/contents/coding-exercises
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Spring Boot REST Exercise",
  "position": 2,
  "instructions": "Implement GET and POST endpoints using Spring Boot.",
  "starterRepositoryUrl": "https://gitlab.com/example/java-rest-starter",
  "deadline": null,
  "allowLateSubmission": true
}
### Get contents
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/1/modules/2/contents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Coding Exercise
GET http://localhost:8080/api/coding-exercises/23
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Check mixed module contents
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/{{codingCourseId}}/modules/{{codingModuleId}}/contents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}